# Written for this pack. Travel facts checked against Polestar 0.3.2's travel data
# (boats Rut'theran - Auberdine and Auberdine - Stormwind Harbor).
guide groupe-alliance/02-rendez-vous-hurlevent
title Group 1 · Meet in Stormwind
folder Group Alliance
faction Alliance
levels 10-12
zone Stormwind City
next groupe-alliance/03-marche-de-l-ouest

step Night Elves: Darnassus to Stormwind
  only NightElf
  zone Darkshore
  tip Portal down to Rut'theran Village, boat to Auberdine, then the Stormwind boat from the same pier.
  note Druids: Cure Poison at 14, Aquatic Form at 16 and Cat Form at 20 come from class quests (Polestar guides, Class).
  getfp "Auberdine"

step Stormwind: meeting point
  zone Stormwind City
  tip Play at your own pace: quests already turned in tick themselves and the guide picks up where you are, so friends who play at other times can go ahead or fall behind. Together, group XP is best within 4 levels; ahead of the others, help them with their quests when you play together.
  getfp "Stormwind"
  task "Group up with your friends when they are online" optional
